e,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"68006543-8e48-00ec-de49-9f3314f2260e":{"name":"signs","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"9a95da6b-2d66-2bd5-d49d-2bd9a77822c5":{"name":"windows","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"d3ec6761-c63d-5745-1aba-affa52c7020c":{"name":"fx_window_1","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"9a939010-2ced-3fc8-c848-b4045a09b8e6":{"name":"fx_window_2","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"7adf627b-3024-2b4d-d016-a3832e23d8d0":{"name":"fx_window_3","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"ee854fda-2e57-c7a2-8955-47ac7cf4c341":{"name":"fx_window_4","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false}}}],"description":"# forge_l1\n\nCasting Hearth (forge level 1): an open stone hearth under a lean-to roof, clay crucibles in the coals, moulds and a water tub.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a squat dark-grey stone smithy on a cobble yard with a stepped furnace hood, a glowing furnace mouth and a tall iron-banded chimney, and a dark slate lean-to over the open working side. An anvil with a trip hammer, a quench trough, big leather bellows, a grindstone, tool and weapon racks, a pallet of ingots, a coal heap and a smouldering charcoal mound. The working clip pumps the bellows and swings the hammer.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a squat dark-grey stone smithy on a cobble yard with a stepped furnace hood, a glowing furnace mouth and a tall iron-banded chimney, and a dark slate lean-to over the open working side. An anvil with a trip hammer, a quench trough, big leather bellows, a grindstone, tool and weapon racks, a pallet of ingots, a coal heap and a smouldering charcoal mound. The working clip pumps the bellows and swings the hammer.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 6 columns (96 x 96 units, 2.70 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -48..49, y 0..134, z -48..49 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 384, construction_0 27, construction_33 261, construction_66 327, ruined 224 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `forge_l1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 80 x 76 x 64 centred at the origin (open front)\n\n## Clips\n\n- `working` (1.6 s, loop): the bellows pump and the trip hammer strikes the anvil twice.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (23, 16, 14)\n- `fx_smoke` at (23, 135, 31)\n- `slot_work` at (-20, 0, -6)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -40)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-24, 48, 48.2)\n- `fx_window_2` at (24, 48, 48.2)\n- `fx_window_3` at (0, 48, 48.2)\n- `fx_window_4` at (48.2, 48, 26)"}